    {
      "id": "claim_e9412cdc47934661b6367e1bdd715dd3",
      "statement": "Zero Share is a fully serverless static frontend: Astro builds with output 'static' mounting Svelte components client:only, with a service-worker integration for PWA support, and no server-side runtime or relay exists anywhere in the app.",
