    },
    {
      "id": "claim_662ea9b9ec004cd98a9410f3d8b63ddd",
      "statement": "Offer establishment mints the RSA keypair exactly once at the top of generateOfferLink (before the peer exists), creates the RTCPeerConnection with a data channel (ordered:false) using the predicate-resolved ICE server, generates the local offer, then waits for ICE candidates to finish or a 3-second timeout (WAIT_ICE_CANDIDATES_TIMEOUT) before building the offer link; a per-invocation offerBuilt flag claims the build synchronously so the two paths build the link at most once and the timeout fallback can never rotate the key, and synchronous construction/offer-creation failures are caught and toasted instead of leaving the spinner stuck.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/components/OfferPage.svelte#L140-L204",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ac9c10553f9f98809f1947e99a2e83289b00aecf5df5ff635db952d5bf082f35:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/components/OfferPage.svelte#L63-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:78fc2c55b560e3b3ae66be6e027034eebb90cae6903fc62bea80132c45065812:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_168fa874ca494eb0b49c143450d46e27",
      "statement": "The answer peer decodes the attacker-controllable `s` URL param via sdpDecode (which throws synchronously on empty, invalid-base64, or non-SDP input) inside a try/catch that surfaces an 'Invalid SDP in link' toast instead of crashing the page during load (PR #45); the setOfferSDP promise is kept and awaited before createAnswer with a signalingState === 'have-remote-offer' check, so a rejected setRemoteDescription flips offerFailed and the UI renders an error state ('offer in the link is invalid') instead of the spinner spinning forever; it then awaits the validated p-param key import (a malformed key downgrades the session to plaintext) and produces the answer code sdpEncode(answerSdp) + '|' + base64(RSA public key) with the same 3-second ICE candidate timeout fallback.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/components/ReceivePage.svelte#L138-L178",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae357d9454cce157c733521cb403de2034be521aba815babde32f2e006098306:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/components/ReceivePage.svelte#L246-L256",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e71811ab8199d97277a5bb1c4595cb25686669b7e4b38a46015786163219ff5c:"
        },
        {
